@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft JhengHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classBorderColor #555555
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFBEA
skinparam noteBorderColor #B39B4D
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
hide circle
hide empty members
title 會員短例：同一個名字 describe，三個方法

class Member #F4F4F4 {
  + describe() : String
}
class VipMember #FFFFFF {
  <color:#1D6694><b>+ describe() : String  {@Override}</b></color>
  <color:#B4532A><b>+ describe(points : int) : String</b></color>
  <color:#B4532A><b>+ describe(event : String) : String</b></color>
}
Member <|-- VipMember
note right of VipMember
  <color:#1D6694><b>藍＝覆寫</b></color>：簽名與父類別相同
  　執行時看<b>實際物件</b>選版本
  <color:#B4532A><b>橘＝過載</b></color>：同名、參數不同
  　編譯時看<b>引數</b>選簽名
end note
note bottom of Member
  父類別只有零參數的 describe()
  → describe(int) 不是覆寫，
  　加 @Override 會編譯失敗（第 8 週的伏筆）
end note
@enduml
